    <!--
        Tick specs (priceTick=tick_size, quantityTick derived from lot_decimals) are sourced from Kraken's
        public AssetPairs REST endpoint, queried by altname, e.g.:
        https://api.kraken.com/0/public/AssetPairs?pair=XBTEUR
        Each instrument bean below has a comment with the Kraken pair id and the raw tick_size/lot_decimals
        values it was derived from; re-query the endpoint periodically to catch tick-size changes.
    -->
